<title>WESTERN SAMOA: RUGBY UNION-SAMOA BEAT FIJI 26-17, TAKE TRI-SERIES.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SAMOA BEAT FIJI 26-17, TAKE TRI-SERIES.</headline>
<dateline>APIA, Western Samoa 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Samoa beat</p>
<p>Fiji 26-17 (halftime 17-7) to win the Pacific tri-series</p>
<p>tournament in Apia on Saturday. The third tournament member was</p>
<p>Tonga.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Western Samoa - Tries: Vaaiga Tuigamala, Tala Leasamaivo.</p>
<p>Conversions: Earl Vaa (2), Penalties: Vaa (4)</p>
<p>Fiji - Tries: Nickie Little, Mosese Raulini. Conversions:</p>
<p>Little (2), Penalty: Little.</p>
</text>
